  m_text: "You must save your beloved princess! To be together again, you must navigate
    the forbidden Water Temple to save her, but beware of hazards and traps.\n\n\u2022
    Use WASD or arrow keys to move\n\u2022Spacebar to jump\n\u2022 Hold [F] to use
    your flame stream ability\n\u2022Be on the lookout for fellow soldiers throughout
    the area; they often have important information to share.\n"
